                        <td>For students considering audio engineering, music production, recording technology, or commercial music programs.</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td><div class="lesson-heading">Artists & Developing Producers</div></td>
                        <td>For musicians who want to record themselves more effectively, develop unfinished ideas, improve arrangements, or build a more dependable production process.</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td><div class="lesson-heading">Mixing Students</div></td>
                        <td>For producers and engineers working on balance, EQ, compression, depth, automation, reference listening, and mix translation.</td>
